# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, on purpose
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# samples/ samples_i6/ samples_soft/ samples_stock/ samples_straight/
#   These look like build output but are not reproducible. Running
#   `make_v8_pack.py --tone stock` today yields different audio from the
#   committed samples_stock/ (different file sizes, every loop differs), so
#   the generator has drifted from whatever produced these packs. samples_soft
#   is explicitly "the original v1 pack" with no generator left at all, and
#   samples/ carries 12 WAVs that its own manifest.txt no longer lists.
#   Treat all five as irreplaceable source data. ~13 MB total.
#
# can_msg/
#   36 MB of logic-analyzer CAN captures (can_table_1, can_test_9,
#   new_msg.csv). Kept because they are the evidence behind the TPDO mapping
#   in README §5 and cannot be re-taken without the bench. They are plain CSV
#   and compress well, but they do sit in history forever. To keep them out,
#   uncomment:
# can_msg/*.csv
# can_msg/can_table_*
# can_msg/can_test_*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If .venv or a binary is already in the pushed history, .gitignore alone will
# not remove it:
#     git rm -r --cached .venv drive_kbd
#     git commit -m "stop tracking build output and the virtualenv"
# That stops tracking them going forward but leaves them in history, so the
# clone stays large. To purge, use git-filter-repo (or re-init if the repo is
# young and private).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Firmware bring-up scratch and vendor samples
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# firmware/*/test holds Zephyr / NXP SDK sample projects used for bring-up,
# along with their CMake build output -- the rpmsg_service build tree alone is
# 26 MB and 1805 files. None of it is this project's source, and it is all
# regenerated by west/cmake. Covers firmware/wheel_firmware/test and
# firmware/ecu_firmware/test.
firmware/*/test/
